{"4617630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tight Tactics", "steam_appid": 4617630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4803180, 4840770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Essence of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You take command of a tactical squad in combat. Each unit has only one action: attack, move, or play a skill card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/ae5fa082650a88d3f9997fb50c17bbc9.avif?t=1787163201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras_big/ae5fa082650a88d3f9997fb50c17bbc9.webp?t=1787163201 width=1560 height=753 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no unit upgrades here. Instead, you collect and improve a deck of cards that your units can use. These cards can be upgraded and combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.poster.avif?t=1787163201\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.webm?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.mp4?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><br>Each specialization has its own strengths and weaknesses, so your tactics will depend on the composition of both your squad and the enemy's. To win a battle, you must assess not only how advantageous a position is, but also what it will cost to reach it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.poster.avif?t=1787163201\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.webm?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.mp4?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Essence of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You take command of a tactical squad in combat. Each unit has only one action: attack, move, or play a skill card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/ae5fa082650a88d3f9997fb50c17bbc9.avif?t=1787163201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras_big/ae5fa082650a88d3f9997fb50c17bbc9.webp?t=1787163201 width=1560 height=753 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no unit upgrades here. Instead, you collect and improve a deck of cards that your units can use. These cards can be upgraded and combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.poster.avif?t=1787163201\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.webm?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/95bc073e4b9cebf7061cb41eb8969f6d.mp4?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><br>Each specialization has its own strengths and weaknesses, so your tactics will depend on the composition of both your squad and the enemy's. To win a battle, you must assess not only how advantageous a position is, but also what it will cost to reach it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.poster.avif?t=1787163201\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.webm?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/extras/99026d11e74bf6b4fe56ac2c16b1880e.mp4?t=1787163201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Be ready for turn-based combat in this roguelite to kick off with the enemy opening fire on you first, trying to keep you from regrouping, and one bad decision leading to the death of your entire upgraded squad", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617630/22f27246f431aa769653abd22a9b544e81790921/header.jpg?t=1787163201", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/